sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant CC as CartContext
  participant LS as localStorage
  participant PS as productService.js
  participant BE as POST /api/coupons/offers
  participant R as coupons.py rules
  U->>CC: add product to cart
  CC->>LS: save id, qty, colour (never prices)
  CC->>PS: getProductsByIds(ids)
  PS-->>CC: fresh products with current prices
  CC->>BE: items (id and qty only) and payment method
  BE->>BE: subtotal from DB prices
  loop every live coupon
    BE->>R: ineligible_reason(): min order, payment method, first order, per-user limit
    R-->>BE: reason, or OK
    BE->>R: discount_for(): percent, cap, or flat
  end
  BE-->>CC: offers sorted, best saving first
  U->>CC: apply a coupon
  CC->>CC: totals = calcTotals(lines, discount)
  Note over CC: Changing the cart, payment method or user re-runs this. A coupon that stops being valid is dropped with a message.
